      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pack cementation at approximately 900 °C for several hours will incorporate aluminum into the near-surface region of equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will produce a thin, continuous, Al-rich diffusion layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-rich diffusion layer will transform into a continuous, adherent Al2O3 scale during high-temperature oxidation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting alumina scale is thermodynamically stable and has low oxygen permeability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina scale will act as an oxygen-diffusion barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxygen-diffusion barrier will mitigate oxidation and pesting of the underlying alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will not alter the alloy's bulk mechanical properties.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "During a 5-hour exposure to air at 800 °C, coated material will have a markedly lower oxidation rate and mass gain than untreated material.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After coating and oxidation exposure, the alloy will retain 8–16% room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After coating and oxidation exposure, the alloy will retain a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C at strain rates of 10^-4–10^-2 s^-1.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
